[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3780.789, "timestamp": "01:03:00", "text": "这就是我身处困境时的状态。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3785.109, "timestamp": "01:03:05", "text": "就像你思考这个问题时所处的位置一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3789.109, "timestamp": "01:03:09", "text": "我唯一的选择是去中国。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3792.63, "timestamp": "01:03:12", "text": "但中国将会是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3793.829, "timestamp": "01:03:13", "text": "你管这叫什么？你管这叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3795.829, "timestamp": "01:03:15", "text": "参观物品或我需要的东西，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3799.75, "timestamp": "01:03:19", "text": "公民身份证之类的东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3801.67, "timestamp": "01:03:21", "text": "那不是真的，那不会发生的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3803.589, "timestamp": "01:03:23", "text": "我肯定我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3806.39, "timestamp": "01:03:26", "text": "甚至像去其他州一样去拜访我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3811.19, "timestamp": "01:03:31", "text": "那一刻，我的祖国"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3815.029, "timestamp": "01:03:35", "text": "我的意思是，我可以吃巴沙，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3816.63, "timestamp": "01:03:36", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3818.15, "timestamp": "01:03:38", "text": "画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3820.47, "timestamp": "01:03:40", "text": "但是，是的，就像那样。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3821.859, "timestamp": "01:03:41", "author": "@indus_exe", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/3H8vMblwahIZO8b2GD0A74_Icoy2nYSc-vPhPQaMyxmxROMbYn_u_WQldiMtQTBwAKQsXG-rZw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Japan, and now China. Wow. "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3823.589, "timestamp": "01:03:43", "text": "不可能，对吧？另一种方法是……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3824.884, "timestamp": "01:03:44", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Shhh... Wreo_indus EXE, Joq is resting. 🌙 Welcome to the Guild, and enjoy the past joq's memories!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3826.95, "timestamp": "01:03:46", "text": "找个朋友帮帮我，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3829.109, "timestamp": "01:03:49", "text": "并非每个人都愿意这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3831.91, "timestamp": "01:03:51", "text": "那就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3833.51, "timestamp": "01:03:53", "text": "通常情况下，这都是为了保护您的隐私，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3836.15, "timestamp": "01:03:56", "text": "你这是在泄露你的主要个人信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3838.39, "timestamp": "01:03:58", "text": "细节等等。那真的很难"}]